# W1 headed path: the browser joins the opt-in Distillery Chronicle fixture
# over the existing WebRTC door, then realizes its three read-only job cards.
wait
assert snap remote-link == webrtc
assert snap remote-state == open
assert snap remote-revision == 11
assert snap remote-cards == 3
act session-remote
settle 1
assert snap session == remote
capture distillery_chronicle_w1_mounted
wait
log distillery Chronicle W1 headed receipt complete
